      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=1)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-5,label=-5,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=2)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** acid, cold, fire  
      **Condition Immunities** blinded, charmed, deafened, exhaustion, frightened, grappled, prone, restrained  
      **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., Passive Perception 8  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Amorphous.*** The ooze can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.

      ***Corrosive Form.*** Nonmagical ammunition is destroyed immediately after hitting the ooze and dealing any damage. Any nonmagical weapon takes a cumulative -1 penalty to attack rolls immediately after dealing damage to the ooze and coming into contact with it. The weapon is destroyed if the penalty reaches -5. The penalty can be removed by casting the [Mending](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619033-mending) spell on the weapon.

      The ooze can eat through 2-inch-thick, nonmagical metal or wood in 1 round.

      ## Actions

      ***Pseudopod.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Pseudopod]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+1,dicelabel=Damage [Pseudopod]) Acid damage. Nonmagical armor worn by the target takes a -1 penalty to the AC it offers. The armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10. The penalty can be removed by casting the [Mending](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619033-mending) spell on the armor.

